<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-2" style="align-items:center;">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">OUR STORY</span>
        <h1 style="max-width:none;">A new chapter for training on Cape Cod.</h1>
        <p>Zezze Athletics opened its doors at 2 Tupper Rd in Sandwich, Massachusetts, in partnership with Cape Cod Holistic Fitness. The space was designed for one purpose: help athletes and individuals improve performance, build strength, and invest in their long-term health.</p>
        <p>Whether you're chasing a personal record, coming back from an injury, or simply committing to getting stronger, the programming here starts with how you move — and builds from there.</p>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/facility-wide.jpg" alt="Zezze Athletics grand opening at 2 Tupper Rd, Sandwich, MA">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-dark">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">HOW WE COACH</span>
      <h2>Individualized. Not generic.</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--concrete);">Every client starts with a movement consult so coaching is built around your body and your goals — not a one-size program.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="panel panel-dark">
        <div class="panel-tag">01</div>
        <h3>Assess</h3>
        <p>We start with a free movement consult to understand how you move, where you're limited, and what you're training for.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="panel panel-dark">
        <div class="panel-tag">02</div>
        <h3>Build a Plan</h3>
        <p>Your coach programs sessions around your sport, schedule, and current ability — adjusted as you progress.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="panel panel-dark">
        <div class="panel-tag">03</div>
        <h3>Train Consistently</h3>
        <p>One coach, one athlete, every session. We track progress and adjust the plan so you keep moving forward.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="facility-strip">
  <img src="/images/stock/coach-spot.jpg" alt="Coach spotting an athlete during training" onerror="this.src='/images/facility-wide.jpg'">
</section>

<section class="section text-center">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>In partnership with Cape Cod Holistic Fitness</h2>
    <p class="text-center">Zezze Athletics is grateful for the support of Cape Cod Holistic Fitness and everyone who has been part of this journey so far. This is just the beginning.</p>
    <a href="/booking" class="btn btn-primary">Book Your First Session</a>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
